# Site-specific configuration for test/hook_overhead_benchmark.sh. It names a
# device, an adb endpoint and a local workload path, none of which belong in a
# repository meant to be shareable.
.bench.local

# Staged benchmark workload for test/hook_overhead_benchmark.sh. An
# application-sized binary plus its inputs, far too large to vendor -- the gate
# reads it from here through .bench.local. Ignored so it cannot be committed by
# accident.
test/bench_workload/
